==Trivia==
*This ending theme song has the most supporting characters sing.
*This ending theme song has the most variants. 
*This is the first ending theme song to feature live singing during the air of the episodes. 
*This is the first ending theme to feature human characters since the ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun and Moon]]'' version of [[Type: Wild]] (excluding the reused ending themes for ''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series|Pokémon: To Be a Pokémon Master]]'').
*Out of every rap stanzas featured in Part 2, [[Friede]]'s stanza, featuring {{p|Charizard}}, is the only one that does not appear in the full version of the song. Instead, his part includes the [[Regional form]]'s rap, that was featured in every variant of Part 1.
